    "created_at": "2015-10-06T14:11:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-06T14:11:40Z",
    "body": "Is that different than \"limited to non-negative numbers greater than zero\" which is specified for the \"size\" attribute on HTMLInputElement?\n",
