    "created_at": "2015-10-06T15:35:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-06T15:35:26Z",
    "body": "Yes, https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#limited-to-only-non-negative-numbers-greater-than-zero says \"or 1 if there is no default value\" (used by col and colgroup). `<input size>` and `<textarea cols rows>` have default values specified.\n\nIt seems the spec is fine here.\n",
